 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Added
+
+- Add v1 `Files.Upload`, which uploads a file from just a file name and an
+  `io.Reader`, encoding the multipart body for you (mirroring
+  `CallLogs.AddRecording`). `Files.Add` remains available for full control
+  over the request body.
+
+### Fixed
+
+- `RawClient.Do` now buffers request bodies that `net/http` cannot replay
+  natively (such as `*os.File`), so uploads through `Files.Add` and
+  `Files.Update` retry on 429/502/503/504 like every other call. Previously
+  a 429 failed such requests immediately even with
+  `RetryPolicy{RetryAllMethods: true}`. Pass `WithNoRetry()` per request to
+  keep streaming very large bodies without buffering.
+
 ## [1.11.0] - 2026-08-18
 
 ### Added
